<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan BSPA buys 54,000 tonnes soybeans at tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan BSPA buys 54,000 tonnes soybeans at tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taichung division of Taiwan's Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association bought a 54,000-tonne shipment of Brazilian soybeans from Peavey at tender on Thursday, traders said.</p>
</text>
